     3→ *
     4→ * Provides REST-style endpoints for task CRUD operations:
     5→ * - GET /api/tasks - List all tasks (requires workspace_path)
     6→ * - GET /api/tasks/:id - Get task by ID (requires workspace_path)
     7→ * - POST /api/tasks - Create a new task (requires workspace_path)
     8→ * - PATCH /api/tasks/:id - Update a task
     9→ * - DELETE /api/tasks/:id - Delete a task
    10→ * - GET /api/tasks/:id/specs - Get task PRD/subtasks/logs
    11→ * - POST /api/tasks/batch/events - Apply event to multiple tasks
    12→ * - GET /api/tasks/:id/running - Check if task execution is running
    13→ *
    14→ * Agent-related task endpoints:
    15→ * - GET /api/agent/:agentId/tasks - Get tasks by agent
    16→ * - GET /api/agent/:agentId/sessions/:sessionId/tasks - List tasks by session
    17→ * - GET /api/agent/:agentId/sessions/:sessionId/tasks/:taskId/messages - Get task messages
    18→ *
    19→ * For CLI-style POST /api/task/* endpoints, see ./task.ts
    20→ *
    21→ * IMPORTANT: All tasks are stored in workspace directories:
    22→ * <workspace>/.viben/tasks/<date>-<slug>/task.json
    23→ */
