## 3. `packages/core/src/cli/commands/index.ts` — Command registration

`/Users/lxy/Documents/GitHub/LinXueyuanStdio/viben/packages/core/src/cli/commands/index.ts`

```ts
import type { Command } from "commander";
import { registerFooCommand } from "./foo";

export function registerCommands(program: Command): void {
  registerFooCommand(program);
  // ...
}
```

Each command lives in its own file (`./foo.ts`) that exports `registerFooCommand(program: Command): void`. The file just calls `program.command(...)` inside that function. To add a new command: create the file, add an import, and add one call in `registerCommands`.

