## 4. `packages/core/src/gateway/routes/index.ts` — Route registration

`/Users/lxy/Documents/GitHub/LinXueyuanStdio/viben/packages/core/src/gateway/routes/index.ts`

```ts
import type { FastifyInstance } from "fastify";
import type { AppState } from "../state";
import { registerFooRoutes } from "./foo";

export function registerRoutes(fastify: FastifyInstance, state: AppState): void {
  registerFooRoutes(fastify);           // stateless routes
  registerBarRoutes(fastify, state);    // stateful routes need state
}

// Also re-exports every registration function for external use
export { registerFooRoutes } from "./foo";
```

Routes that need background services (SSE, sessions, queues) receive `state`. Purely CRUD routes for config files (providers, models, ideas, skills) receive only `fastify`.

